      "command": "python3 <NDF>/scripts/supervise.py queue <TMP>/out/sprint/3-design-merge-16.json --max 3 --done <TMP>/out/sprint/done-3.json --then <TMP>/out/sprint/4-design-results.json --then <TMP>/out/sprint/5-sprint-branch.json --then <TMP>/out/sprint/6-impl-16.json <TMP>/out/sprint/6-impl-17.json --then <TMP>/out/sprint/7-check.json --then <TMP>/out/sprint/8-release.json",
